Subject: [PATCH] feat(legal-kb): trust workflow, audit trail and incremental
 insert (part 4B-2)

- migration 0002_version_audit: append-only audit in separate schema <schema>_audit
  (trigger blocks UPDATE/DELETE/TRUNCATE; no FK so history outlives rows)
- markVerified / revokeVerification / correctVersion / listAudit: every change writes
  its audit record in the same transaction; compare-and-set via versionContentHash
  under a row lock; correcting text clears verification
- insertIncremental: validate new law against a context skeleton of existing documents
  with the real loadCorpus; issue paths mapped back to input indexes; append-only, atomic
- refactor insert.ts (assertNoClashes/insertFlat), no SQL change
- 95 new tests (differential A+incremental(B) == insert(A u B), races, atomicity,
  upgrade from 0001); 508 existing tests untouched; mutation: 32/32 killed
- docs: handoff 0007, task 0008, ADR-0005, README, glossary, pitfalls, high-risk
